From 90c8810a9e571bca70b6b2569346fec3f5d412bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:41:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): a Plasma cutting machine mode, so the plasma
 table and its operations can be reached from the ribbon

The machine mode switch had three rows (Milling, Turning, Mill-turning),
so the Tormach 1300PL and its Plasma section could not be reached from
the ribbon. The table gains a Plasma cutting row mounting the built-in
Tormach 1300PL through the same undoable LoadBuiltinMachine. Each row's
text now names the section it adds, read from the registry. A structural
test fails when a machine kind with a shipped machine has no mode row, or
a row names a machine that is missing or of another kind.

Fixes #1195

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
